title: In pytest.toml an indented key after a quoted addopts is its own setting (#327)
origin: issue #327: `[pytest]` is TOML in pytest 9's pytest.toml, where a string is never
origin2: continued; the indented `testpaths` after it stays a setting, and narrowing it is read
=== before: pytest.toml ===
[pytest]
addopts = "-ra"
  testpaths = ["tests"]
=== after: pytest.toml ===
[pytest]
addopts = "-ra"
  testpaths = ["tests/unit"]
